Negative responses mark role descriptions and personal-pronoun appositions:
'As a ...', 'you are a ...', 'we, ...', 'here in ...', and some possessive
roles/affiliations. Positive exceptions are 60, Our Lady/Lord, and commas
after example/instance. Most other tokens get zero. Only five earlier tokens
are retained, and document boundaries clear that history.
