"""A token-sensitive lexical mixture, chiefly in Chinese.

Updating, improving, assuring, and control words give negative values;
freshness and 'fall into' give positive values. Layer counting is more
negative than a layer used inside a compound. Soaking/bubbles are positive,
but the final character of 'light bulb' is not. Small responses cover user,
structure, maintenance, and plural-suffix tokens. English ' under' is boosted
in licensing phrases. Doubled middle dots are positive. Everything else is
