At row/document starts, source-file headers and question labels have
position-specific responses.
In Vietnamese, untoned modified vowels usually give negative responses; a small
additive onset/vowel/coda rule distinguishes their spellings. It is deliberately
not a word lookup. Unrecognized text gets a near-zero prediction.
