"""Language-sensitive short spelling fragments, especially s-bearing endings.

Hungarian -ás/-és, Dutch diminutives and function words, and Finnish s
syllables give negative contributions. Romanian s words and some marked
sibilant letters give positive ones. Language is estimated from recent
words using dictionary frequencies; uncertain language guesses are suppressed.
Hungarian sz is treated separately from s. State resets at each document.
